# BUILD-SYSTEM NOTE: In an ament_cmake package (unlike pure-Python
# ament_python packages, which generate console entry points from setup.py),
# Python executables are these thin wrapper scripts. CMake's
# install(PROGRAMS ...) copies them into lib/spark_verify_pkg/, which is
